@startuml KaminoSEQ1
title Kamino Lending Market on Solana — Main Actors and Core Flows

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam BoxPadding 10
hide footbox

legend left
	<b>Terminology</b>
	----
	* <b><i>Borrow Capacity</i></b>: Max borrowable amount vs collateral.
	* <b><i>LTV (Loan-to-Value)</i></b>: Borrowed value / collateral value.
	* <b><i>Max LTV (Maximum Loan-to-Value)</i></b>: Protocol borrowing cap.
	* <b><i>Health Factor</i></b>: Distance to liquidation.
	* <b><i>Liquidation Threshold</i></b>: Point where liquidation is allowed.
	* <b><i>Available Liquidity</i></b>: Unborrowed stable in pool.
	* <b><i>Utilization</i></b>: Borrowed / supplied liquidity.
	* <b><i>TVL (Total Value Locked)</i></b>: Total value locked in protocol.
	* <b><i>Bad Debt</i></b>: Unrecovered debt after liquidation.
	* <b><i>Slippage</i></b>: Price impact during swaps.
endlegend

actor "**Issuer / Asset Sponsor**\n//Asset issuer//\n//or sponsor listing//\n//tokenized collateral//\n//**Wants:** Market access//\n//favorable params//" as ISS
actor "**Borrower**\n//End user or//\n//desk posting//\n//collateral//\n//**Wants:** Liquidity//\n//and leverage//" as BOR
actor "**Lender**\n//Stablecoin//\n//supplier to Kamino//\n//pools//\n//**Wants:** Reliable//\n//yield, low bad debt//" as LND
actor "**LP / Market Maker**\n//External DEX//\n//liquidity depth//\n//for swaps/liquidations//\n//**Wants:** Fees and//\n//incentives, tight//\n//markets under stress//" as LP
actor "**Vault Manager**\n//Strategy op//\n//(Kamino or//\n//delegated)//\n//**Wants:** Risk-adjusted//\n//allocation//" as VLT

box "Kamino Company"
    participant "Kamino App / UI" as UI
	actor "**Risk Team**\n//Kamino//\n//internal risk and//\n//listings team//\n//**Wants:** Lender//\n//solvency first//" as RISK
	actor "**Governance / Admin**\n//Kamino param//\n//and policy owner//\n//**Wants:** Safe growth//\n//controlled changes//" as GOV
	actor "**Liquidator Bot**\n//Automated//\n//liquidation actor//\n//in Kamino markets//\n//**Wants:** Capture//\n//liquidation reward//" as LIQ
end box

box "Solana Blockchain" #LightYellow
	participant "Borrower Stablecoin Token Account\n(ATA; SPL Token / Token-2022 mint)" as BTA
	participant "Oracle Program(s)\n(Chainlink / Pyth / Redstone)" as ORCL
	participant "DEX Program(s)\n(Jupiter / Raydium routes)" as DEX
end box

box "Kamino related Solana Blockchain" #LightBlue
	participant "Kamino Lending Program" as KLP
	participant "Kamino Vault Program" as KVP
	participant "Looping Logic" as LOOP
	participant "SPL Token Program" as SPL
end box

== 0) Market Setup ==
autonumber 1
ISS -> RISK: Request market onboarding
RISK -> ORCL: Validate oracle coverage and freshness
RISK -> LP: Require baseline DEX liquidity depth
LP -> DEX: Seed liquidity for collateral-stable routes
RISK -> GOV: Recommend initial conservative risk params
group Atomic Solana transaction (market config instruction)
GOV -> KLP: Configure isolated market and limits
end

== 1) Lend and Borrow ==
autonumber 1
LND -> UI: Supply stablecoin
group Atomic Solana transaction (lender supply instruction + CPI)
UI -> KLP: Deposit request
KLP -> SPL: Transfer stable into pool
KLP --> LND: Credit lender position
end

BOR -> UI: Deposit collateral
group Atomic Solana transaction (collateral deposit instruction + CPI)
UI -> KLP: Collateral deposit request
KLP -> SPL: Transfer collateral into pool
KLP -> ORCL: Fetch collateral price
end
BOR -> UI: Borrow stablecoin
UI -> KLP: Borrow request
group Atomic Solana transaction (borrow instruction + CPI)
KLP -> ORCL: Re-check health factor
KLP -> KLP: Update obligation/reserve state (PDAs)
KLP -> SPL: CPI transfer stable to borrower token account
SPL -> BTA: Credit stablecoin balance
end
KLP --> BOR: Borrow committed (state + transfer)

== 2) Liquidation ==
autonumber 1
KLP -> ORCL: Continuous price checks
alt Position below threshold
	LIQ -> KLP: Liquidation transaction
	group Atomic Solana transaction (liquidation instruction + CPI)
	KLP -> SPL: Seize collateral
	KLP -> DEX: Swap collateral to stable
	KLP -> SPL: Repay debt / protect lenders
	KLP --> LIQ: Liquidation incentive
	end
else Position healthy
	KLP --> LIQ: Reject liquidation
end

== 3) Looping / Multiply ==
autonumber 1
BOR -> UI: Request leverage loop
UI -> LOOP: Build atomic transaction
group Atomic Solana transaction (loop/flash sequence + CPI)
LOOP -> KLP: Borrow or flash step
LOOP -> DEX: Swap stable to collateral
LOOP -> KLP: Deposit collateral and re-borrow
KLP -> ORCL: Validate each step health
LOOP --> BOR: Leveraged position established
end

== 4) Vault Allocation ==
autonumber 1
LND -> KVP: Deposit stable into vault
group Atomic Solana transaction (vault deposit instruction + CPI)
KVP -> SPL: Transfer stable to vault custody
end
VLT -> KVP: Allocate capital strategy
group Atomic Solana transaction (vault allocation instruction)
KVP -> KLP: Deploy liquidity to isolated markets
KLP --> KVP: Yield and position state updates
end

@enduml
